---
// Chapter 2 cheat sheet: the full request layout, each region labelled with its technique and the lesson that teaches it, plus a rail of layout rules and the isolated sub-agent.
---

<svg
	class="dg"
	viewBox="0 0 720 736"
	role="img"
	aria-labelledby="d2-cem-title d2-cem-desc"
	style="min-width: 630px"
>
	<title id="d2-cem-title">Chapter 2 map: the request, region by region</title>
	<desc id="d2-cem-desc">
		The request top to bottom, each region labelled with its lesson. The static prefix, cached: the system prompt (SOP
		flow, XML under Markdown, few-shot examples; lesson 2.5) and the tool definitions (operating manuals in a fixed
		order; lesson 2.6). Then the trajectory, which grows by appending, with these regions interleaved in the order they arrive; only the status bar has a fixed position, the tail: user and assistant messages (roles, rebuilt on
		every stateless call; lessons 2.1 to 2.2); compressed history (summaries replace raw tool results; lessons 2.9 to
		2.10); tool results (external content, data not instructions; lesson 2.6); the Skill catalog and loaded SKILL.md
		bodies (lesson 2.7); deferred tool schemas, appended once when needed (lesson 2.6); and the status bar as the last
		user message, computed state at the tail (lesson 2.8). The model generates from there. A side rail reads: freeze the
		prefix (lessons 2.3 to 2.4); append only, never rewrite (lesson 2.4); a sub-agent with its own context returns only a
		summary into the tool results (lesson 2.10); distill into conclusions (lessons 2.8 to 2.10).
	</desc>
	<defs>
		<marker id="d2-cem-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse">
			<path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" class="dg-arrowhead"></path>
		</marker>
	</defs>

	<text x="2" y="28" class="dg-title">The request, region by region</text>

	<!-- Static prefix -->
	<g class="dg-container dg-context">
		<rect x="12" y="44" width="484" height="164" rx="12"></rect>
		<text x="24" y="70" font-weight="700">Static prefix, cached</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="24" y="80" width="460" height="56" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="40" y="102" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">System prompt</text>
		<text x="468" y="102" text-anchor="end" font-weight="700">2.5</text>
		<text x="40" y="124" class="dg-sub">SOP flow, XML under Markdown, few-shot</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-tools">
		<rect x="24" y="144" width="460" height="56" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="40" y="166" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Tool definitions</text>
		<text x="468" y="166" text-anchor="end" font-weight="700">2.6</text>
		<text x="40" y="188" class="dg-sub">operating manuals in a fixed order</text>
	</g>

	<!-- Trajectory -->
	<g class="dg-container dg-neutral">
		<rect x="12" y="224" width="484" height="420" rx="12"></rect>
		<text x="24" y="250" font-weight="700">Trajectory, grows by appending</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="24" y="260" width="460" height="56" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="40" y="282" font-weight="700">User and assistant messages</text>
		<text x="468" y="282" text-anchor="end" font-weight="700">2.1–2.2</text>
		<text x="40" y="304" class="dg-sub">roles, rebuilt on every stateless call</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-harness">
		<rect x="24" y="324" width="460" height="56" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="40" y="346" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Compressed history</text>
		<text x="468" y="346" text-anchor="end" font-weight="700">2.9–2.10</text>
		<text x="40" y="368" class="dg-sub">summaries replace raw tool results</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-guard">
		<rect x="24" y="388" width="460" height="56" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="40" y="410" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Tool results</text>
		<text x="468" y="410" text-anchor="end" font-weight="700">2.6</text>
		<text x="40" y="432" class="dg-sub">external content: data, not instructions</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="24" y="452" width="460" height="56" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="40" y="474" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Skill catalog and SKILL.md bodies</text>
		<text x="468" y="474" text-anchor="end" font-weight="700">2.7</text>
		<text x="40" y="496" class="dg-sub">catalog stays visible, bodies load on demand</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-tools">
		<rect x="24" y="516" width="460" height="56" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="40" y="538" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Deferred tool schemas</text>
		<text x="468" y="538" text-anchor="end" font-weight="700">2.6</text>
		<text x="40" y="560" class="dg-sub">full schema appended once, when needed</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-harness">
		<rect x="24" y="580" width="460" height="56" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="40" y="602" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Status bar, last user message</text>
		<text x="468" y="602" text-anchor="end" font-weight="700">2.8</text>
		<text x="40" y="624" class="dg-sub">computed state at the tail</text>
	</g>

	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="140" y1="644" x2="140" y2="678" marker-end="url(#d2-cem-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-model">
		<rect x="12" y="680" width="256" height="44" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="140" y="708" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Model generates here</text>
	</g>

	<!-- Rail: layout rules and the isolated sub-agent -->
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="516" y="80" width="192" height="120" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="532" y="110" font-weight="700">Freeze the prefix</text>
		<text x="532" y="136" class="dg-sub">same bytes on</text>
		<text x="532" y="158" class="dg-sub">every call</text>
		<text x="532" y="184" font-weight="700">2.3–2.4</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="516" y="260" width="192" height="100" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="532" y="290" font-weight="700">Append only</text>
		<text x="532" y="316" class="dg-sub">never rewrite</text>
		<text x="532" y="342" font-weight="700">2.4</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-model">
		<rect x="516" y="376" width="192" height="124" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="532" y="404" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Sub-agent</text>
		<text x="532" y="430" class="dg-sub">own context,</text>
		<text x="532" y="452" class="dg-sub">returns a summary</text>
		<text x="532" y="484" font-weight="700">2.10</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="516" y1="416" x2="486" y2="416" marker-end="url(#d2-cem-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-harness">
		<rect x="516" y="516" width="192" height="120" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="532" y="546" font-weight="700">Distill into</text>
		<text x="532" y="570" font-weight="700">conclusions</text>
		<text x="532" y="596" class="dg-sub">not raw records</text>
		<text x="532" y="620" font-weight="700">2.8–2.10</text>
	</g>
</svg>
